      "writtenOn": "2021-07-13T08:27:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Limiting it to only \u0027compatibility libraries\u0027 might not be sufficient because vendor module can depend on other prebuilt sdk_library.\n\nSo, I wanna fix it more generally, so made it return conditionally.\n - If it is included in apex, it returns in-apex path,\n - If not, it returns \u003cpartition\u003e/framework/\u003cstem\u003e.jar",
